    "verseCount": 3,
    "content": "<p class=\"d\">A Song of Ascents.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"1\" data-sid=\"PSA 134:1\" class=\"v\">1</span>Look! Praise Yahweh, all you servants of Yahweh,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 134:1\" class=\"q2\">who stand by night in Yahweh’s house!</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"2\" data-sid=\"PSA 134:2\" class=\"v\">2</span>Lift up your hands in the sanctuary.</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 134:2\" class=\"q2\">Praise Yahweh!</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"3\" data-sid=\"PSA 134:3\" class=\"v\">3</span>May Yahweh bless you from Zion,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 134:3\" class=\"q2\">even he who made heaven and earth.</p>",
